COMMENT ON TABLE "pipeline"."provider_course_lists" IS 'CF-247 22 Oct 2026: a provider''s own course list or course finder page entered by a person; read by job course-list-read for its course links (with their link text), which are added to the provider''s site addresses (pipeline.coverage_provider_urls, source course_list) for the page matchers. Read again every course_list.reread_days.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "pipeline"."provider_course_lists"."link_pattern" IS 'CF-247 22 Oct 2026: when set, url is a site map and only page addresses fitting this pattern (JavaScript regular expression, case-insensitive) are kept.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "pipeline"."provider_course_lists"."child_pattern" IS 'CF-247 22 Oct 2026: the files of a site map index that are followed (pattern on their address); all when null.';



COMMENT ON COLUMN "pipeline"."provider_course_lists"."read_via" IS 'CF-247 22 Oct 2026: map = the site is listed by a Firecrawl map of url (1 credit) and the addresses fitting link_pattern are kept; null = read as a page or site map.';



